          "@value": "Systematically triages and resolves `sorry` stubs across the Lean codebase. Inventories all sorry sites, orders them by dependency, attempts proofs using mathlib/library search, and escalates to a proof writer with similar-lemma suggestions when stuck."
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "proof-triage",
      "dcterms:source": "cat-harness/skills/folio-paper-adapter/proof-triage.md",
