          "@value": "smart-stack-layering"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Which of the five layers a WHO SMART asset, rule, script or page belongs to, and the one question that settles it. Read before adding anything to fhir-harness, smart-base, smart-l1, smart-dak or smart-ig, before creating a per-IG harness, and before moving a pre/post-processing step."
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "smart-stack-layering",
